Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.35,0:21:23.15,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fad(150,0)}與追兵牽起手 Pa Pa Pa (Pa)
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.98,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}殺手與忍者在 Dance Dance Dance (Da)
